1
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:03,920
Jiaojiao.

2
00:02:04,439 --> 00:02:05,000
Qianjin.

3
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:07,959
What's wrong?

4
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:12,280
Jin Jingran bullied me.

5
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,439
He bullied me.

6
00:02:14,439 --> 00:02:15,840
Take your time. Take it slow.

7
00:02:16,439 --> 00:02:17,879
They're all picking on me.

8
00:02:17,879 --> 00:02:19,360
Jiao, change the IV!

9
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:21,919
Wait for me a second.

10
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,479
My life is so miserable!

11
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,120
Coming!

12
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:27,080
He said he'd take me home.

13
00:02:27,479 --> 00:02:28,240
And then...

14
00:02:28,759 --> 00:02:29,400
he...

15
00:02:37,199 --> 00:02:37,639
Phone call.

16
00:02:44,759 --> 00:02:45,319
What are you doing?

17
00:02:46,039 --> 00:02:46,520
Are you busy?

18
00:02:48,159 --> 00:02:49,120
Big Brother.

19
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:54,400
You... calling me Big Brother now?

20
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,319
Fine, then from now on,

21
00:02:57,479 --> 00:02:58,599
just call me Big Brother.

22
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,879
I... I...

23
00:03:02,879 --> 00:03:03,439
What's wrong with you?

24
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:04,680
I...

25
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,159
Why are you crying?

26
00:03:05,599 --> 00:03:06,639
Is it because that day...

27
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,400
I did something wrong?

28
00:03:10,159 --> 00:03:10,719
Or maybe...

29
00:03:11,719 --> 00:03:14,199
we shouldn't have... you know, done that?

30
00:03:19,639 --> 00:03:21,120
What did you do wrong?

31
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,879
Shouldn't have what?

32
00:03:25,199 --> 00:03:25,680
Who is this?

33
00:03:26,319 --> 00:03:27,080
Big Brother...

34
00:03:27,639 --> 00:03:28,400
It's me...

35
00:03:28,719 --> 00:03:29,680
Qianjin.

36
00:03:49,759 --> 00:03:50,439
Your brother...

37
00:03:52,039 --> 00:03:52,879
What did he say?

38
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,960
Is something going on between you two?

39
00:03:58,479 --> 00:03:59,400
Wh-What?

40
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,879
What could be going on?

41
00:04:02,199 --> 00:04:02,840
Nothing's going on.

42
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,639
He said he was wrong.

43
00:04:06,759 --> 00:04:07,719
That he shouldn't have...

44
00:04:08,879 --> 00:04:11,240
Did... Did he take advantage of you?

45
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:12,719
No.

46
00:04:13,879 --> 00:04:15,879
Why would your brother take advantage of me?

47
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:21,160
Jiaojiao,

48
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:22,959
tell me

49
00:04:23,959 --> 00:04:25,160
it's not what I think.

50
00:04:27,639 --> 00:04:28,399
Say it!

51
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,639
If you say it, I'll believe you.

52
00:04:35,519 --> 00:04:36,160
I'm sorry.

53
00:04:54,199 --> 00:04:55,680
How far have you two gone?

54
00:04:58,839 --> 00:04:59,680
Tell me!

55
00:05:02,279 --> 00:05:03,839
As far as you're thinking,

56
00:05:05,519 --> 00:05:06,720
that's how far we went.

57
00:05:08,959 --> 00:05:10,279
Have you lost your mind?!

58
00:05:10,279 --> 00:05:11,920
Do you even know what you're doing?

59
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,199
He has a wife and kids!

60
00:05:15,199 --> 00:05:16,240
Of all the people in the world,

61
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,399
why him?!

62
00:05:17,399 --> 00:05:18,319
He's a good man.

63
00:05:18,319 --> 00:05:19,240
Ma Laijiao!

64
00:05:19,839 --> 00:05:20,560
A good man?!

65
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:22,199
So you just walk all over our family?!

66
00:05:22,519 --> 00:05:24,279
Do you have any idea what you've done?!

67
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,279
How is our family supposed to

68
00:05:26,279 --> 00:05:28,519
hold our heads up in the village?!

69
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,519
What is wrong with you?!

70
00:05:30,839 --> 00:05:32,279
Have you no shame?!

71
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,120
I'm telling you,

72
00:05:48,279 --> 00:05:49,399
this slap...

73
00:05:50,079 --> 00:05:51,759
someone was bound to give it to you sooner or later.

74
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:56,680
I never want to see you again.

75
00:05:57,839 --> 00:05:59,720
Stay away from our family!

76
00:06:30,319 --> 00:06:32,560
Sai Qianjin wished she could turn back time,

77
00:06:34,160 --> 00:06:36,319
to when she didn't need to know anything

78
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:39,399
and had nothing to worry about.

79
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:41,920
Her father,

80
00:06:42,759 --> 00:06:43,439
her husband,

81
00:06:44,439 --> 00:06:46,120
her brother, and her friends...

82
00:06:47,399 --> 00:06:49,160
Everyone she had ever loved

83
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:51,639
had completely changed.

84
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:54,040
Sister-in-law!

85
00:06:55,759 --> 00:06:56,639
I saved some food for you.

86
00:06:56,839 --> 00:06:58,079
I don't want food.

87
00:06:58,759 --> 00:07:00,199
Is my brother home?

88
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,199
He went to the construction site.

89
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:03,040
Hurry and call him back!

90
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,879
Won't he be back after work anyway?

91
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:08,519
Right now! Tell him to come back this second!

92
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:10,079
Why are you throwing a tantrum?

93
00:07:10,199 --> 00:07:10,680
Dad's in the hospital,

94
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:11,879
and you're just giving your brother a hard time?

95
00:07:11,879 --> 00:07:12,480
No, I'm not!

96
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:19,600
What's the matter with you?

97
00:07:26,319 --> 00:07:27,519
Are you going to eat or not?

98
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:31,000
I'm not eating!

99
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,040
I'm not eating!

100
00:07:37,839 --> 00:07:38,920
Such a temper!

101
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:51,839
Xiuming,

102
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:57,000
why lock the door in broad daylight?

103
00:07:57,439 --> 00:07:57,959
Wait, what...

104
00:07:59,120 --> 00:07:59,560
What do you want?

105
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:01,439
Didn't you ask about the equipment?

106
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:02,240
I finished crunching the numbers.

107
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,519
Came to let you know.

108
00:08:04,879 --> 00:08:06,480
That truck crane you wanted,

109
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,040
a used one is 100,000 yuan.

110
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:10,199
And a six-cubic-meter concrete mixer,

111
00:08:10,319 --> 00:08:11,240
a new one is 250,000.

112
00:08:11,639 --> 00:08:12,240
A used one,

113
00:08:12,759 --> 00:08:14,560
the lowest I could go is 120,000 yuan.

114
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:16,920
A used Type 30 loader is 100,000 yuan.

115
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:18,800
Plus some other gear,

116
00:08:19,279 --> 00:08:20,439
all together, conservatively,

117
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:21,959
it'll be about 350,000.

118
00:08:22,519 --> 00:08:22,879
It's just...

119
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:28,000
What's with the sighing?

120
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:30,519
Stop sighing already!

121
00:08:30,519 --> 00:08:31,720
Look, in our company account,

122
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,960
there isn't much money left.

123
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,679
The Phase 3 payment hasn't arrived yet.

124
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,759
Can't buying the equipment wait?

125
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:38,200
Look, Xiuming.

126
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:40,159
Those guys don't want to work anymore.

127
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,080
What are you doing resting over there?

128
00:08:45,559 --> 00:08:46,120
Get back to work!

129
00:08:46,279 --> 00:08:46,840
We're not getting paid anyway.

130
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:47,919
I'm quitting. Going home.

131
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:48,840
No pay!

132
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:50,399
Talk to them nicely.

133
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:51,960
Keep it civil!

134
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:34,159
Look at you,

135
00:09:34,639 --> 00:09:35,759
sneaking up and sitting here quietly.

136
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,039
I thought you were asleep.

137
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:41,519
What's on your mind?

138
00:09:43,679 --> 00:09:45,039
Right now, besides you,

139
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,639
there's really no one I can talk to.

140
00:09:50,519 --> 00:09:51,559
Uncle Ma has already pulled out.

141
00:09:51,559 --> 00:09:52,639
What about you and my dad?

142
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,039
What are you going to do?

143
00:09:55,759 --> 00:09:56,759
You're asking me?

144
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:58,120
I was going to ask you.

145
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,679
Have you really thought this through?

146
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:02,879
To stick with my dad through this?

147
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:04,960
Can I say no at a time like this?

148
00:10:05,559 --> 00:10:06,639
He's lying in a hospital bed.

149
00:10:07,159 --> 00:10:08,240
If I turn him down now,

150
00:10:08,559 --> 00:10:09,799
wouldn't that just kill him?

151
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,200
But you've got to think it through.

152
00:10:12,039 --> 00:10:13,360
If you keep going with him,

153
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,879
that Phase 3 payment is up in the air.

154
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:15,879
And the consequences...

155
00:10:15,879 --> 00:10:17,879
Well, I wanted to talk to you about that, too.

156
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,279
So tell me,

157
00:10:19,759 --> 00:10:20,159
what...

158
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:21,360
what should we do?

159
00:10:26,639 --> 00:10:27,519
Uncle Wei, right now,

160
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:29,919
I'm like a rope.

161
00:10:30,879 --> 00:10:31,960
My dad is on one end,

162
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:33,360
and Shi Yongnian is on the other.

163
00:10:34,159 --> 00:10:35,440
The two of them are in a tug-of-war.

164
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:37,200
So tell me...

165
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:38,879
what's going on with them?

166
00:10:38,879 --> 00:10:40,200
There has to be some bad blood,

167
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,480
some kind of grudge between them, right?

168
00:10:41,799 --> 00:10:42,240
Whenever I ask,

169
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,279
you never tell me anything.

170
00:10:43,279 --> 00:10:44,879
Can you just level with me this time?

171
00:10:44,879 --> 00:10:45,960
What really happened between them?

172
00:10:54,519 --> 00:10:55,000
Well...

173
00:10:56,919 --> 00:10:58,279
What... what could there be?

174
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,440
The three of us old brothers,

175
00:11:01,799 --> 00:11:03,279
back then, with Shi Yongnian,

176
00:11:03,879 --> 00:11:05,159
we used to work together.

177
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:06,480
That was it.

178
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:08,879
When was that?

179
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:09,879
18 years ago.

180
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:12,240
You were in school in Beijing back then, right?

181
00:11:12,679 --> 00:11:13,240
Around that time.

182
00:11:15,639 --> 00:11:17,039
But back then, my dad...

183
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:19,120
hadn't he not even started the crew yet?

184
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:19,600
Right.

185
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,320
Back then, we were just

186
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,159
taking odd jobs,

187
00:11:23,559 --> 00:11:24,360
making small change.

188
00:11:24,879 --> 00:11:25,480
That was all.

189
00:11:25,799 --> 00:11:26,399
And after that?

190
00:11:26,519 --> 00:11:28,120
How did Shi... Shi Yongnian

191
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:29,159
end up leaving?

192
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,639
Well, that Shi Yongnian,

193
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:35,399
he had bigger ambitions.

194
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:38,759
A small place like Honggang couldn't hold him.

195
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:40,000
Looking at it now, of course,

196
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:40,879
he was right.

197
00:11:40,879 --> 00:11:41,720
If he'd stayed here,

198
00:11:42,279 --> 00:11:43,600
at best he'd end up like me.

199
00:11:43,919 --> 00:11:45,480
Now he's a real estate tycoon.

200
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,240
Just because of that?

201
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:49,879
Is... is it really that simple?

202
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:51,039
What else could it be?

203
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:03,639
Uncle Wei, tell me,

204
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:07,960
in this tug-of-war,

205
00:12:08,519 --> 00:12:09,080
who's going to win?

206
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:12,120
What tug-of-war?

207
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:36,519
Laijiao

208
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:48,960
Laijiao

209
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:00,720
Jiao.

210
00:13:07,799 --> 00:13:08,159
Come here.

211
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:09,720
Come on, come over here.

212
00:13:14,759 --> 00:13:15,759
How did Qianjin bully you?

213
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:19,399
I was wrong.

214
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:22,399
I was really wrong.

215
00:13:22,519 --> 00:13:23,279
Don't say that.

216
00:13:23,279 --> 00:13:24,000
When you say that,

217
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:24,919
then I'm in the wrong, too.

218
00:13:25,399 --> 00:13:26,360
I've let you down.

219
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:28,240
If I'd known, I wouldn't have gotten divorced.

220
00:13:28,399 --> 00:13:29,039
Don't... Please don't.

221
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:30,159
When he beat me,

222
00:13:30,519 --> 00:13:31,279
Don't talk about that.

223
00:13:31,279 --> 00:13:32,360
I should've just endured it.

224
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:32,919
No, not at all.

225
00:13:32,919 --> 00:13:33,759
If I'd just put up with it,

226
00:13:33,879 --> 00:13:34,200
No.

227
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:35,639
my whole life would've passed.

228
00:13:35,639 --> 00:13:36,639
Divorcing him was the right choice.

229
00:13:36,639 --> 00:13:38,159
You deserve to be loved and cherished.

230
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:45,279
Xiuming.

231
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:47,120
Xiuming.

232
00:13:49,519 --> 00:13:51,399
Xiuming.

233
00:13:51,759 --> 00:13:53,000
It's okay, it's alright.

234
00:13:54,039 --> 00:13:54,519
I'm right here.

235
00:13:54,879 --> 00:13:55,559
I'll always be here for you.

236
00:14:26,519 --> 00:14:27,080
Come on.

237
00:14:27,519 --> 00:14:28,559
Didn't you want to talk to me?

238
00:14:28,679 --> 00:14:29,759
Here I am. Go ahead.

239
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:31,799
I don't even know what to say to you.

240
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:35,960
Look...

241
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:38,720
About our situation...

242
00:14:39,159 --> 00:14:40,360
you didn't tell anyone, did you?

243
00:14:40,679 --> 00:14:41,279
What situation?

244
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:42,720
What are you talking about?

245
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:44,320
What nonsense is there to tell?

246
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:45,080
Cut the crap.

247
00:14:47,399 --> 00:14:47,759
I told them.

248
00:14:48,799 --> 00:14:49,519
Told Dad.

249
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:50,200
Told Sister-in-law.

250
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:50,879
Told Zhenzhu.

251
00:14:50,879 --> 00:14:52,320
I told the whole village with a bullhorn!

252
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:52,840
Our business...

253
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:53,519
Stay out of it.

254
00:14:53,559 --> 00:14:54,679
As if I even want to!

255
00:14:54,679 --> 00:14:55,919
Why would I care about that crap?

256
00:14:55,919 --> 00:14:57,120
With all this mess going on,

257
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:59,120
I just don't understand.

258
00:14:59,399 --> 00:15:00,480
What more do you want?

259
00:15:00,639 --> 00:15:01,639
What do you really want?

260
00:15:01,639 --> 00:15:02,840
What has this family denied you?

261
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:03,480
I want Ma Laijiao.

262
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:04,679
Did you hear me?

263
00:15:04,879 --> 00:15:05,840
I want Ma Laijiao, okay?

264
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:06,759
Are you out of your mind?

265
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:07,639
Have you lost your damn mind?

266
00:15:07,639 --> 00:15:08,240
Yeah, I'm crazy!

267
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:09,279
In this damn family,

268
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:10,639
I've acted normal for over ten years!

269
00:15:10,679 --> 00:15:11,840
Living this miserable, half-dead life,

270
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:12,679
shouldn't I go crazy?

271
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:14,759
Sai Qianjin,

272
00:15:15,679 --> 00:15:17,559
leave Ma Laijiao the hell alone from now on!

273
00:15:17,879 --> 00:15:18,919
If you bully me, I'll take it.

274
00:15:18,919 --> 00:15:19,679
If you dare lay a finger on her,

275
00:15:20,159 --> 00:15:21,240
I will fight you to the death!

276
00:15:49,559 --> 00:15:50,639
I came to lay all my cards on the table.

277
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:55,200
These five cards...

278
00:15:55,679 --> 00:15:56,759
are everything I own.

279
00:15:57,679 --> 00:15:58,919
There's 27,000 left on this one.

280
00:15:59,679 --> 00:16:00,360
On this one...

281
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:02,240
This one is 9,000 in debt.

282
00:16:03,519 --> 00:16:05,919
These three are just for rotating loans.

283
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,480
Now I'm handing all five to you.

284
00:16:11,159 --> 00:16:12,080
I know I'm a good-for-nothing.

285
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:14,039
I've sold rebar, traded dogs,

286
00:16:14,279 --> 00:16:15,559
and peddled seafood,

287
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:17,080
used cars, jade...

288
00:16:17,399 --> 00:16:18,279
I lost money on every single venture.

289
00:16:18,639 --> 00:16:20,240
My family got demolition payouts,

290
00:16:20,639 --> 00:16:22,480
but that money isn't mine to touch.

291
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:24,240
I have no car or house to my name.

292
00:16:24,519 --> 00:16:25,720
There are five siblings in all.

293
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:26,799
Mom passed away,

294
00:16:27,279 --> 00:16:28,000
and the old man is sick.

295
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:29,720
You already know all these basic facts.

296
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:34,600
I'm not really good enough for you.

297
00:16:36,039 --> 00:16:37,240
You graduated from a real university,

298
00:16:37,799 --> 00:16:39,000
and you have a decent job.

299
00:16:40,519 --> 00:16:41,600
Above all, you're pretty.

300
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:43,480
You know what?

301
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:45,080
The first time I saw you,

302
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:45,759
I just thought...

303
00:16:46,399 --> 00:16:46,840
I'm done for.

304
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:48,200
I, Sai Xiuhe,

305
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:50,159
will definitely fall for you, Hao Zhihua.

306
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:51,960
I really like you.

307
00:17:00,159 --> 00:17:00,720
I know...

308
00:17:01,879 --> 00:17:02,840
I'm broke right now,

309
00:17:03,679 --> 00:17:04,480
and I can't provide for you.

310
00:17:05,759 --> 00:17:06,480
But I can earn it.

311
00:17:07,319 --> 00:17:08,720
A lot of people say I'm reckless,

312
00:17:09,119 --> 00:17:10,079
and that I'm just fooling around.

313
00:17:10,759 --> 00:17:12,559
But I know I'm not a bad person.

314
00:17:13,559 --> 00:17:14,839
I'm neither lazy nor stupid.

315
00:17:15,519 --> 00:17:17,160
I can make money with my own two hands.

316
00:17:18,079 --> 00:17:19,200
I want to be with you.

317
00:17:19,759 --> 00:17:21,079
I have even more drive to make money now.

318
00:17:22,960 --> 00:17:24,000
Can you give me a chance?

319
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:33,319
Money...

320
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:35,000
We can make it together.

321
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:36,039
We've got plenty of time.

322
00:17:39,559 --> 00:17:40,000
The two of us...

323
00:17:41,759 --> 00:17:43,039
can do so much more together.

324
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:08,200
The incision is healing well.

325
00:18:08,839 --> 00:18:10,079
We'll keep you under observation for a few days.

326
00:18:10,559 --> 00:18:11,720
If there are no complications,

327
00:18:11,880 --> 00:18:12,480
in a couple of days,

328
00:18:12,599 --> 00:18:13,440
you can get ready to go home.

329
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:15,200
He can be discharged?

330
00:18:15,279 --> 00:18:15,599
Yes.

331
00:18:16,119 --> 00:18:17,519
Thank you so much. Thank you.

332
00:18:18,039 --> 00:18:19,319
All right, we'll get back to work.

333
00:18:20,279 --> 00:18:20,960
Thank you, thank you.

334
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:21,799
Goodbye.

335
00:18:27,119 --> 00:18:28,039
Surviving a close call

336
00:18:28,519 --> 00:18:29,519
means good fortune ahead.

337
00:18:33,519 --> 00:18:34,960
Being debt-free is true wealth,

338
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:37,240
and being healthy is true fortune.

339
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:39,079
This hurdle...

340
00:18:39,319 --> 00:18:40,559
is tough to get over.

341
00:18:42,240 --> 00:18:42,960
All right.

342
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:44,680
Look...

343
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:46,119
About the merger,

344
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:47,480
Xiuliang and I will handle it.

345
00:18:47,559 --> 00:18:48,440
Just focus on recovering.

346
00:18:49,200 --> 00:18:50,599
As for Lao Ma,

347
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:52,519
we know what's on his mind.

348
00:18:52,839 --> 00:18:53,440
He's got his pride,

349
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:54,680
and worries about holding us back.

350
00:18:55,079 --> 00:18:55,880
After all these years,

351
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:57,160
he just worries too much.

352
00:18:58,240 --> 00:18:59,039
Let's not force him.

353
00:19:00,039 --> 00:19:01,240
Let's have Lawyer Sai update us

354
00:19:01,359 --> 00:19:03,039
on the Changfu Construction acquisition.

355
00:19:10,119 --> 00:19:10,960
Wei Changfu

356
00:19:11,799 --> 00:19:12,880
is indeed still hesitating.

357
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:15,519
I've been working on him recently.

358
00:19:16,799 --> 00:19:17,440
I will, as soon as—

359
00:19:17,519 --> 00:19:18,359
As soon as what?

360
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:20,160
Why did I hear

361
00:19:21,039 --> 00:19:21,759
that these companies

362
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:24,319
are in talks to merge?

363
00:19:34,839 --> 00:19:35,240
Mr. Shi,

364
00:19:35,920 --> 00:19:37,680
I was just about to report on this.

365
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:39,920
While dealing with them,

366
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:42,039
I found out

367
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:45,039
they originally planned to merge.

368
00:19:45,519 --> 00:19:46,640
At this critical juncture,

369
00:19:47,359 --> 00:19:48,000
it wasn't easy for me

370
00:19:48,559 --> 00:19:49,400
to push too hard.

371
00:19:49,759 --> 00:19:51,440
So I worked on Ma Jiucheng first,

372
00:19:51,720 --> 00:19:52,519
and he has already pulled out.

373
00:19:52,799 --> 00:19:53,519
That leaves only my dad.

374
00:19:53,640 --> 00:19:54,920
He really is sick right now,

375
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:55,920
and I'm looking for the right opening.

376
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:57,079
Once he agrees,

377
00:19:57,079 --> 00:19:57,680
then this matter...

378
00:19:57,680 --> 00:19:59,200
Does any of that matter?

379
00:20:00,319 --> 00:20:00,720
Of course,

380
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:02,839
regarding your dad's condition,

381
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:03,839
I'm sympathetic.

382
00:20:04,279 --> 00:20:05,119
But you must realize

383
00:20:05,559 --> 00:20:07,359
this is the company's overall strategy.

384
00:20:07,599 --> 00:20:08,720
A lot of our next steps

385
00:20:09,359 --> 00:20:10,160
are waiting on you.

386
00:20:10,960 --> 00:20:11,400
I know.

387
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:14,839
So please, give me a little more time.

388
00:20:14,839 --> 00:20:15,960
How much time do you need?

389
00:20:16,559 --> 00:20:17,119
A week?

390
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:18,599
A month?

391
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,119
Or wait until

392
00:20:20,440 --> 00:20:21,759
their merger goes through,

393
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:22,960
and they come back to dictate terms to me?

394
00:20:28,200 --> 00:20:28,799
A couple of days ago,

395
00:20:28,799 --> 00:20:29,920
I had dinner with some old friends.

396
00:20:30,839 --> 00:20:31,720
They told me

397
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:33,599
that at a business dinner,

398
00:20:34,039 --> 00:20:34,920
they ran into your Uncle Wei.

399
00:20:36,200 --> 00:20:37,359
Your Uncle Wei asked them

400
00:20:37,680 --> 00:20:39,359
if there were any projects available to take on.

401
00:20:40,319 --> 00:20:41,000
I was very surprised.

402
00:20:42,640 --> 00:20:43,240
Lawyer Sai,

403
00:20:44,359 --> 00:20:45,039
let me ask you.

404
00:20:46,680 --> 00:20:48,839
Why would a company about to be acquired

405
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:52,000
still be scrambling to bid on projects?

406
00:20:53,400 --> 00:20:54,079
The way I see it,

407
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:55,960
Wei Changfu's company

408
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:57,920
has zero intention of being acquired.

409
00:20:58,359 --> 00:20:59,440
Ma Jiucheng might have pulled out,

410
00:21:00,240 --> 00:21:01,119
but those other two

411
00:21:01,559 --> 00:21:02,640
are still talking merger.

412
00:21:02,799 --> 00:21:04,319
Did you know about this or not?

413
00:21:05,680 --> 00:21:06,480
Mr. Shi, please let me explain.

414
00:21:06,480 --> 00:21:07,519
If you didn't know,

415
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:10,359
that means your father is lying to you.

416
00:21:10,599 --> 00:21:11,559
If you did know,

417
00:21:12,039 --> 00:21:13,200
then you're lying to me.

418
00:21:14,319 --> 00:21:14,759
Answer me.

419
00:21:21,599 --> 00:21:22,480
Mr. Shi, what you mean...

420
00:21:22,480 --> 00:21:23,000
I understand.

421
00:21:23,839 --> 00:21:24,680
Their intentions...

422
00:21:25,519 --> 00:21:26,480
I actually did know about them.

423
00:21:26,759 --> 00:21:29,400
That's why I worked on Ma Jiucheng first.

424
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:31,279
Did you persuade Ma Jiucheng to withdraw,

425
00:21:32,240 --> 00:21:34,119
or did the lack of the Phase 3 payment

426
00:21:34,480 --> 00:21:35,400
make him quit on his own?

427
00:21:52,559 --> 00:21:53,000
Mr. Shi,

428
00:21:54,039 --> 00:21:54,400
I'd like...

429
00:21:56,519 --> 00:21:57,519
I want to ask you a question.

430
00:21:57,519 --> 00:21:58,200
You have to

431
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:00,440
tell me the truth.

432
00:22:00,440 --> 00:22:01,319
Back when you were

433
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:04,119
acquiring Changfu Construction,

434
00:22:04,319 --> 00:22:06,200
did you plan to clear them both out?

435
00:22:08,359 --> 00:22:09,880
If they broke any rules,

436
00:22:10,079 --> 00:22:11,519
you could just have them rectify it.

437
00:22:11,720 --> 00:22:13,279
Why push them to ruin?

438
00:22:13,480 --> 00:22:15,079
I pushed them to ruin?

439
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:20,039
The sea sand found on the job site—

440
00:22:20,119 --> 00:22:21,160
did I put it there?

441
00:22:21,759 --> 00:22:23,599
Unclear duties, mixing business and personal funds—

442
00:22:23,720 --> 00:22:24,720
did I teach them that?

443
00:22:25,079 --> 00:22:26,160
Rusted firefighting gear,

444
00:22:26,319 --> 00:22:27,839
breaching construction safety rules—

445
00:22:28,079 --> 00:22:29,160
did I tell them to do that?

446
00:22:29,519 --> 00:22:30,839
I'm pushing them to ruin?

447
00:22:31,559 --> 00:22:32,599
Seems to me

448
00:22:33,119 --> 00:22:34,599
they brought ruin upon themselves!

449
00:22:35,359 --> 00:22:36,799
He needs proper nutrition after discharge.

450
00:22:37,160 --> 00:22:39,119
Plus, Sai Duoxi's body fat is a bit high.

451
00:22:39,240 --> 00:22:40,079
He really needs to lose weight.

452
00:22:41,640 --> 00:22:43,000
I heard that for older people,

453
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:44,720
if they've been heavy since they were young,

454
00:22:45,039 --> 00:22:45,960
sudden weight loss in old age

455
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:46,799
is actually bad for their health.

456
00:22:47,440 --> 00:22:48,359
He needs good nutrition,

457
00:22:48,359 --> 00:22:49,079
like I said,

458
00:22:49,079 --> 00:22:49,839
but losing weight

459
00:22:49,839 --> 00:22:51,200
is still necessary in moderation.

460
00:22:51,480 --> 00:22:52,440
Being overweight is really bad for the prostate.

461
00:22:52,799 --> 00:22:53,079
All right.

462
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:53,519
Sister-in-law.

463
00:22:53,519 --> 00:22:54,079
That's about it.

464
00:22:56,960 --> 00:22:57,640
Uncle Wei is here.

465
00:22:58,200 --> 00:22:58,640
Sister-in-law,

466
00:22:59,839 --> 00:23:01,160
I need to talk to you.

467
00:23:16,119 --> 00:23:16,559
What is it?

468
00:23:28,200 --> 00:23:29,440
What I said that day

469
00:23:30,799 --> 00:23:31,720
was indeed a bit harsh.

470
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:33,799
But that's just how I am.

471
00:23:36,119 --> 00:23:37,279
I speak without thinking.

472
00:23:38,440 --> 00:23:39,640
About that bridal shop,

473
00:23:41,519 --> 00:23:42,319
don't take it to heart.

474
00:23:43,279 --> 00:23:43,680
I'm not doing it.

475
00:23:46,519 --> 00:23:47,079
I can't do it.

476
00:23:51,799 --> 00:23:52,319
Sister-in-law,

477
00:23:54,119 --> 00:23:55,079
you've got it so hard.

478
00:24:27,440 --> 00:24:28,000
Get out, get out of the car!

479
00:24:28,480 --> 00:24:28,799
Alright.

480
00:24:31,119 --> 00:24:31,680
What's going on?

481
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:33,680
So many people.

482
00:24:38,599 --> 00:24:39,799
Take your men and seal off that area.

483
00:24:40,039 --> 00:24:40,279
Got it.

484
00:24:40,279 --> 00:24:40,640
Seal off that side!

485
00:24:40,640 --> 00:24:41,440
Take your team and seal that side!

486
00:24:41,680 --> 00:24:42,359
Take your team and seal that side!

487
00:24:42,799 --> 00:24:43,920
You four, follow me!

488
00:24:44,079 --> 00:24:44,359
Yes, sir.

489
00:24:44,359 --> 00:24:44,799
Seal it all off!

490
00:24:44,799 --> 00:24:45,799
Stop, stop, stop! Tools down!

491
00:24:46,200 --> 00:24:47,000
Hold on! Stop right now!

492
00:24:48,720 --> 00:24:49,680
Stop working! Work is halted!

493
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:50,519
Seal up this finance office!

494
00:24:50,759 --> 00:24:52,039
What are you doing? What's going on?

495
00:24:52,880 --> 00:24:53,720
Are you in charge here?

496
00:24:53,880 --> 00:24:54,440
What is this?

497
00:24:54,720 --> 00:24:55,559
Who the hell are you?

498
00:24:55,559 --> 00:24:56,079
Let me tell you.

499
00:24:56,079 --> 00:24:57,559
We're hired by Tengyue Group

500
00:24:57,559 --> 00:24:58,599
as a third-party supervision unit.

501
00:24:58,960 --> 00:25:00,160
Here is the Stop-Work Order.

502
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:01,000
This site is shut down.

503
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:04,039
Wait, boss, why are you shutting us down?

504
00:25:04,039 --> 00:25:04,640
The fact that we're here

505
00:25:04,640 --> 00:25:05,960
proves there are quality issues.

506
00:25:05,960 --> 00:25:06,880
Shut it down first.

507
00:25:07,640 --> 00:25:08,799
Coming down! Coming down!

508
00:25:08,839 --> 00:25:09,400
Wait, don't!

509
00:25:09,599 --> 00:25:10,880
Our quality is fine!

510
00:25:11,039 --> 00:25:13,160
It's this company that owes us money!

511
00:25:13,160 --> 00:25:14,279
I already told you.

512
00:25:14,279 --> 00:25:15,759
We're third-party supervisors.

513
00:25:15,759 --> 00:25:16,799
Got issues? Take it up with Tengyue.

514
00:25:16,960 --> 00:25:17,640
Get them down first!

515
00:25:17,759 --> 00:25:18,480
It's Tengyue!

516
00:25:18,559 --> 00:25:20,200
Tengyue withheld the Phase 3 payment!

517
00:25:20,200 --> 00:25:20,680
Enough, brother.

518
00:25:20,680 --> 00:25:21,440
Just say... say less.

519
00:25:21,519 --> 00:25:22,240
Keep it down for now.

520
00:25:22,640 --> 00:25:23,680
Come down, everyone come down!

521
00:25:24,599 --> 00:25:26,119
Everyone come down! Stop working!

522
00:25:26,519 --> 00:25:27,039
Sai Xiuliang.

523
00:25:28,559 --> 00:25:29,559
The only reason

524
00:25:29,559 --> 00:25:31,160
you can sit here talking to me today

525
00:25:31,799 --> 00:25:34,160
is Tengyue Group hiring you as counsel.

526
00:25:34,519 --> 00:25:36,000
Regarding the acquisition of Changfu,

527
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:37,880
I expect some professionalism from you

528
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:39,000
and sound professional opinions.

529
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:40,119
Mr. Shi, look.

530
00:25:40,920 --> 00:25:43,839
Commercial acquisitions are mutual agreements.

531
00:25:44,039 --> 00:25:45,480
Right now, the target company

532
00:25:45,759 --> 00:25:47,519
is strongly resisting.

533
00:25:48,039 --> 00:25:50,519
Especially with their plan to merge.

534
00:25:50,839 --> 00:25:52,640
That makes this very difficult for us.

535
00:25:52,839 --> 00:25:54,680
It's not something legal terms and talks

536
00:25:54,799 --> 00:25:55,839
can easily force through.

537
00:25:55,839 --> 00:25:56,519
Good.

538
00:25:59,279 --> 00:26:00,960
Very good. Highly professional.

539
00:26:01,279 --> 00:26:02,319
Which is precisely why

540
00:26:02,599 --> 00:26:03,759
I dispatched the new supervision team

541
00:26:03,759 --> 00:26:05,160
to your family's construction site

542
00:26:05,519 --> 00:26:07,279
to inspect the schedule and quality.

543
00:26:08,119 --> 00:26:09,319
The results will be ready shortly.

544
00:26:09,680 --> 00:26:10,559
This will also decide

545
00:26:10,559 --> 00:26:12,200
whether the group honors the contract

546
00:26:12,599 --> 00:26:14,160
and releases the Phase 3 payment.

547
00:26:14,640 --> 00:26:15,119
Lawyer Sai,

548
00:26:15,680 --> 00:26:16,799
I think rather than the two of us

549
00:26:16,799 --> 00:26:18,039
debating subjective willingness,

550
00:26:18,759 --> 00:26:20,559
the inspection results will speak for themselves.

551
00:26:20,920 --> 00:26:22,880
And move things forward more effectively.

552
00:26:24,440 --> 00:26:24,880
Wouldn't you agree?

553
00:26:30,119 --> 00:26:31,680
With Old Ma pulling out,

554
00:26:32,960 --> 00:26:34,680
we have to discuss this all over again.

555
00:26:36,799 --> 00:26:37,160
Hello?

556
00:26:38,240 --> 00:26:38,640
Go ahead.

557
00:26:40,240 --> 00:26:40,720
What did you say?

558
00:26:42,880 --> 00:26:44,079
What's going on here?

559
00:26:46,480 --> 00:26:46,799
Okay.

560
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:48,400
Alright, I got it.

561
00:26:49,279 --> 00:26:50,079
Something came up again?

562
00:26:50,839 --> 00:26:52,200
Something's up. I'll go check it out first.

563
00:26:52,960 --> 00:26:53,839
Just rest and recover.

564
00:26:53,880 --> 00:26:54,839
I'll pick you up when you're discharged.

565
00:26:56,720 --> 00:26:57,480
Sixty thousand yuan.

566
00:26:58,279 --> 00:26:59,000
Take it and use it.

567
00:26:59,640 --> 00:27:00,519
As for the bridal shop,

568
00:27:00,759 --> 00:27:01,720
we'll run it together.

569
00:27:02,279 --> 00:27:02,720
If it's not enough...

570
00:27:03,359 --> 00:27:03,680
I...

571
00:27:04,880 --> 00:27:06,240
This is all I have.

572
00:27:06,680 --> 00:27:07,599
I've given you everything.

573
00:27:21,599 --> 00:27:23,640
Don't cry. What are you crying for?

574
00:27:27,160 --> 00:27:27,519
Jiayin.

575
00:27:28,160 --> 00:27:29,200
Hurry up, come to the construction site with me!

576
00:27:31,880 --> 00:27:32,640
The site?

577
00:27:35,200 --> 00:27:35,559
You...

578
00:27:36,720 --> 00:27:37,440
Keep this for now.

579
00:27:37,960 --> 00:27:38,559
Take good care of Dad.

580
00:27:40,480 --> 00:27:41,519
Let me tell you, Boss Sai.

581
00:27:41,519 --> 00:27:42,720
Sir, I just need to grab my bag.

582
00:27:42,960 --> 00:27:43,680
Not even your bag.

583
00:27:45,559 --> 00:27:47,759
Sir, can't I even go in and grab my bag?

584
00:27:47,839 --> 00:27:49,799
What are you doing? What's going on here?

585
00:27:51,720 --> 00:27:53,599
What you're doing isn't right.

586
00:27:54,079 --> 00:27:55,880
Tell us what's non-compliant, and we'll fix it.

587
00:27:55,880 --> 00:27:56,359
Isn't that right?

588
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:58,160
You can't just shut us down out of nowhere!

589
00:27:58,759 --> 00:27:59,839
If you halt work like this,

590
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:01,599
then next year, for Changfu Construction,

591
00:28:01,599 --> 00:28:02,640
our qualification review...

592
00:28:02,799 --> 00:28:03,839
we won't stand a chance of passing it!

593
00:28:03,839 --> 00:28:04,319
Let go of me!

594
00:28:04,319 --> 00:28:04,640
Hey!

595
00:28:04,759 --> 00:28:05,240
What are you doing?

596
00:28:05,279 --> 00:28:05,799
Hello, Mr. Chen?

597
00:28:05,839 --> 00:28:06,599
No, they're...

598
00:28:06,599 --> 00:28:07,480
Stop calling! Hang up!

599
00:28:07,480 --> 00:28:07,880
Xiuming!

600
00:28:08,119 --> 00:28:08,680
All right, all right!

601
00:28:08,680 --> 00:28:09,079
Getting physical, huh?

602
00:28:09,079 --> 00:28:09,759
That's enough!

603
00:28:10,400 --> 00:28:12,000
What—what's going on?

604
00:28:12,480 --> 00:28:13,200
We received a report

605
00:28:13,799 --> 00:28:15,960
that this site is severely behind schedule,

606
00:28:15,960 --> 00:28:16,880
violating construction protocols,

607
00:28:17,039 --> 00:28:18,240
and breaching safety regulations.

608
00:28:18,359 --> 00:28:18,680
Look here.

609
00:28:18,960 --> 00:28:20,519
Approved by Tengyue Group,

610
00:28:20,519 --> 00:28:21,839
this is the issued Stop-Work Order.

611
00:28:23,160 --> 00:28:23,519
Uncle,

612
00:28:23,960 --> 00:28:26,160
they withheld the Phase 3 payment from us!

613
00:28:26,400 --> 00:28:27,680
That's what caused the delay!

614
00:28:27,759 --> 00:28:28,160
Exactly!

615
00:28:28,319 --> 00:28:29,880
We're just following protocol.

616
00:28:29,880 --> 00:28:30,640
Then give us the Phase 3 payment!

617
00:28:30,640 --> 00:28:31,200
Let me tell you,

618
00:28:31,200 --> 00:28:32,799
this site is being shut down today, no exceptions.

619
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:34,240
If you have complaints, take it to the higher-ups.

620
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:34,960
You're screwing with me, huh?

621
00:28:35,160 --> 00:28:35,480
That's right.

622
00:28:35,680 --> 00:28:36,400
It won't be that easy.

623
00:28:36,599 --> 00:28:37,200
Let me tell you,

624
00:28:38,119 --> 00:28:39,640
if a single nail goes missing from this site,

625
00:28:39,920 --> 00:28:40,799
I'm not letting you off the hook!

626
00:28:41,359 --> 00:28:42,559
Xiuming, don't waste your breath on them.

627
00:28:42,640 --> 00:28:43,720
Let's go find Shi Yongnian.

628
00:28:44,559 --> 00:28:45,200
Let's go.

629
00:28:45,319 --> 00:28:45,720
Jiayin,

630
00:28:46,200 --> 00:28:46,640
keep an eye on them.

631
00:28:47,720 --> 00:28:48,440
Watch over the site.

632
00:28:48,599 --> 00:28:49,079
Don't worry.

633
00:28:49,279 --> 00:28:50,039
They won't take a single nail!

634
00:28:50,039 --> 00:28:50,559
I'm warning you!

635
00:28:50,559 --> 00:28:51,160
Don't worry, bro.

636
00:28:51,160 --> 00:28:52,400
Work stops today!

637
00:28:52,799 --> 00:28:53,839
Evacuate the site!

638
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:55,039
Without notice,

639
00:28:55,359 --> 00:28:57,400
no one is allowed back to work!

640
00:28:58,279 --> 00:28:59,359
Get down here, hurry! Work is halted!

641
00:29:23,319 --> 00:29:24,880
Did you really have to be this ruthless?

642
00:29:25,440 --> 00:29:26,440
My dad is still in the hospital.

643
00:29:26,559 --> 00:29:28,200
He has cancer and just had surgery.

644
00:29:28,519 --> 00:29:29,720
Can't you show him some sympathy?

645
00:29:29,720 --> 00:29:30,200
Sai Xiuliang.

646
00:29:30,599 --> 00:29:32,279
What did I ask you back then?

647
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:34,400
I asked if you were confident about this.

648
00:29:34,400 --> 00:29:35,519
And what did you say to me?

649
00:29:37,880 --> 00:29:39,200
I'm doing this to help you.

650
00:29:40,160 --> 00:29:41,799
Mr. Wei, you really can't go in.

651
00:29:41,799 --> 00:29:42,799
Please don't make it hard on me.

652
00:29:42,920 --> 00:29:44,480
Mr. Shi is in a meeting right now.

653
00:29:44,480 --> 00:29:44,920
I won't give you a hard time.

654
00:29:44,920 --> 00:29:45,599
Whatever it is, tell me.

655
00:29:45,720 --> 00:29:46,319
Right, tell him.

656
00:29:46,319 --> 00:29:47,400
You really can't go in.

657
00:29:47,400 --> 00:29:48,319
He's in a meeting.

658
00:29:48,519 --> 00:29:48,960
Mr. Wei!

659
00:29:48,960 --> 00:29:49,799
Shi Yongnian!

660
00:29:50,359 --> 00:29:51,400
You guys really can't go in.

661
00:29:51,400 --> 00:29:52,000
Shi Yongnian!

662
00:29:52,000 --> 00:29:52,640
I know what's going on.

663
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:53,559
In here.

664
00:29:53,559 --> 00:29:53,880
Let's go.

665
00:29:54,119 --> 00:29:54,720
Shi Yongnian!

666
00:29:55,240 --> 00:29:56,440
Don't push it too far!

667
00:29:56,680 --> 00:29:58,319
You got someone to shut down your own site?

668
00:29:58,680 --> 00:30:00,359
Have you completely lost your mind?

669
00:30:00,960 --> 00:30:01,400
Mr. Wei.

670
00:30:01,920 --> 00:30:02,880
I haven't even gone after you yet,

671
00:30:02,880 --> 00:30:04,160
and here you are confronting me first.

672
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:06,839
Your site violated regulations

673
00:30:07,160 --> 00:30:08,720
and was shut down by the new supervisors.

674
00:30:09,359 --> 00:30:10,240
What does that have to do with me?

675
00:30:10,240 --> 00:30:11,319
Do you take me for a fool?

676
00:30:11,640 --> 00:30:12,759
If you hadn't pulled dirty tricks,

677
00:30:12,759 --> 00:30:14,279
would they just shut it down like that?

678
00:30:14,759 --> 00:30:16,119
I, Wei Changfu, have been in Honggang for 20 years.

679
00:30:16,119 --> 00:30:17,119
Did I build all this for nothing?

680
00:30:17,599 --> 00:30:19,240
You're not just trying to take me over.

681
00:30:19,359 --> 00:30:20,480
You're trying to ruin me, aren't you?

682
00:30:20,480 --> 00:30:22,160
Who's really trying to ruin whom here?

683
00:30:22,720 --> 00:30:23,519
Your construction site

684
00:30:23,519 --> 00:30:25,119
couldn't even pass Tengyue's internal inspection.

685
00:30:25,359 --> 00:30:26,880
Now it's been reported and shut down,

686
00:30:27,160 --> 00:30:28,480
and you're blaming me?

687
00:30:28,480 --> 00:30:29,759
How is that our fault?

688
00:30:30,039 --> 00:30:32,000
Your Phase 3 payment never arrived,

689
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:33,079
which caused our workers to walk off.

690
00:30:33,200 --> 00:30:34,039
I even paid out of my own pocket

691
00:30:34,039 --> 00:30:34,839
to bring those workers back.

692
00:30:34,839 --> 00:30:35,480
Talking like that,

693
00:30:36,079 --> 00:30:37,279
aren't you just trying to pick a fight?

694
00:30:37,279 --> 00:30:37,720
Attorney Sai,

695
00:30:38,160 --> 00:30:38,640
let me ask you.

696
00:30:39,079 --> 00:30:40,720
If the construction team under Changfu

697
00:30:40,839 --> 00:30:42,319
causes a delay in the schedule

698
00:30:42,359 --> 00:30:43,599
due to their own fault,

699
00:30:44,240 --> 00:30:47,039
risking Tengyue Group's breach of contract

700
00:30:47,119 --> 00:30:48,119
and reputational damage,

701
00:30:48,720 --> 00:30:49,240
under the contract,

702
00:30:50,000 --> 00:30:50,599
what does it say?

703
00:31:05,440 --> 00:31:06,079
Attorney Sai

704
00:31:18,200 --> 00:31:19,160
According to the contract,

705
00:31:22,680 --> 00:31:23,480
if Party B's

706
00:31:24,160 --> 00:31:25,000
errors

707
00:31:26,279 --> 00:31:27,160
cause Party A's

708
00:31:27,559 --> 00:31:28,359
costs to increase

709
00:31:29,039 --> 00:31:29,799
or damage its reputation,

710
00:31:30,640 --> 00:31:31,640
Party A has the right

711
00:31:34,319 --> 00:31:35,400
to seek compensation from Party B.

712
00:31:35,400 --> 00:31:36,279
Sai Xiuliang!

713
00:31:36,599 --> 00:31:37,799
What the hell are you saying?

714
00:31:38,079 --> 00:31:38,559
Let me ask you:

715
00:31:38,640 --> 00:31:39,359
are you siding with outsiders,

716
00:31:39,480 --> 00:31:40,279
using this bullshit contract

717
00:31:40,440 --> 00:31:41,240
to confront me? Are you?

718
00:31:41,240 --> 00:31:41,960
When you signed the contract,

719
00:31:41,960 --> 00:31:42,799
why didn't you read it?

720
00:31:43,279 --> 00:31:44,440
You didn't read it yourselves,

721
00:31:44,440 --> 00:31:45,319
so why blame me?

722
00:31:47,279 --> 00:31:47,799
Don't hold me back!

723
00:31:49,519 --> 00:31:50,000
Huzi!

724
00:31:50,440 --> 00:31:51,519
You've thought this through,

725
00:31:51,559 --> 00:31:52,519
and this is how you want to play it?

726
00:31:54,039 --> 00:31:54,319
Fine.

727
00:31:55,200 --> 00:31:56,599
Just fight it out!

728
00:31:56,599 --> 00:31:58,200
Let's see what you're really made of!

729
00:31:58,640 --> 00:31:59,720
Xiuliang, sue us then!

730
00:31:59,920 --> 00:32:00,279
Just you wait!

731
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:01,640
Xiuming, let's go.

732
00:32:02,119 --> 00:32:02,640
Let's go, come on!

733
00:32:02,839 --> 00:32:03,400
Wait, aren't we...

734
00:32:03,400 --> 00:32:03,920
Move! Let's go!

735
00:32:03,920 --> 00:32:05,720
Aren't we gonna beat them up?

736
00:32:44,680 --> 00:32:46,640
Uncle Duoxi, you must stand up for us!

737
00:32:46,640 --> 00:32:46,960
That's right!

738
00:32:46,960 --> 00:32:47,279
Exactly!

739
00:32:47,279 --> 00:32:48,920
We haven't been paid at the site for months!

740
00:32:48,920 --> 00:32:49,279
Seriously!

741
00:32:49,279 --> 00:32:50,319
We're out of options here.

742
00:32:50,319 --> 00:32:51,000
We can't hold out any longer!

743
00:32:51,279 --> 00:32:52,440
Our families need to eat!

744
00:32:52,440 --> 00:32:53,519
Just give us a straight answer!

745
00:32:53,519 --> 00:32:55,279
Can this work or not? Can we keep working?

746
00:32:55,279 --> 00:32:56,000
Uncle, Uncle, Uncle!

747
00:32:56,240 --> 00:32:57,559
I've held them off for days.

748
00:32:57,880 --> 00:32:58,599
I told them to stop making a scene,

749
00:32:58,599 --> 00:32:59,559
but they insisted on seeing you.

750
00:32:59,680 --> 00:33:00,759
Please, I'm begging you all, okay?

751
00:33:01,039 --> 00:33:02,079
Stop making a scene. Let's head back first.

752
00:33:02,160 --> 00:33:03,119
The site's been shut down!

753
00:33:03,279 --> 00:33:04,039
Head back where?

754
00:33:04,039 --> 00:33:04,559
Exactly!

755
00:33:04,559 --> 00:33:05,200
I'll fight you to the end!

756
00:33:05,200 --> 00:33:06,279
Calm down, calm down.

757
00:33:06,400 --> 00:33:07,519
Don't panic. Tell me what happened.

758
00:33:08,359 --> 00:33:09,240
What's really going on?

759
00:33:09,440 --> 00:33:09,799
Uncle...

760
00:33:10,440 --> 00:33:12,319
Our wages are over two weeks late,

761
00:33:12,440 --> 00:33:14,039
and the site's been officially sealed off.

762
00:33:14,160 --> 00:33:15,000
There's no work left.

763
00:33:15,119 --> 00:33:16,000
Where's our money supposed to come from?

764
00:33:16,160 --> 00:33:17,759
I haven't gotten paid either, have I?

765
00:33:17,759 --> 00:33:18,200
Right?

766
00:33:18,400 --> 00:33:20,039
Aren't we all trying to figure something out?

767
00:33:20,039 --> 00:33:20,319
Right?

768
00:33:20,319 --> 00:33:21,440
Stop bullshitting us!

769
00:33:21,599 --> 00:33:23,039
The Phase 3 payment still hasn't arrived.

770
00:33:23,240 --> 00:33:24,039
It's been delayed for so long!

771
00:33:24,200 --> 00:33:25,160
Who's figuring anything out?

772
00:33:25,160 --> 00:33:25,559
Right!

773
00:33:25,759 --> 00:33:27,279
Xiuming won't say a word,

774
00:33:27,640 --> 00:33:29,480
and Xiuliang's nowhere to be found!

775
00:33:29,680 --> 00:33:30,680
I just want to know, on this site,

776
00:33:30,680 --> 00:33:31,480
who's in charge now?

777
00:33:31,480 --> 00:33:31,880
Who calls the shots?

778
00:33:31,880 --> 00:33:32,960
Who has the final say?

779
00:33:32,960 --> 00:33:34,279
Exactly! Who's really in charge?

780
00:33:35,599 --> 00:33:36,319
What are you doing?

781
00:33:36,880 --> 00:33:38,480
Can't you let him speak?

782
00:33:39,200 --> 00:33:39,799
Uncle...

783
00:33:40,200 --> 00:33:41,400
Say something to them.

784
00:33:44,920 --> 00:33:45,839
Bring me my shoes.

785
00:33:47,400 --> 00:33:47,720
Let's go.

786
00:33:47,720 --> 00:33:48,640
My bag, get my bag!

787
00:33:50,440 --> 00:33:50,920
Hurry up!

788
00:33:51,400 --> 00:33:52,599
Call my second son and bring him along.

789
00:33:53,200 --> 00:33:53,519
Go, quickly!

790
00:33:53,839 --> 00:33:55,960
Uncle, calling Second Brother won't help now.

791
00:33:56,920 --> 00:33:57,519
Why won't it help?

792
00:33:58,200 --> 00:34:00,079
He's already handed the ledgers over to Sister-in-law.

793
00:34:01,440 --> 00:34:02,160
To whom?

794
00:34:02,680 --> 00:34:03,079
Sister-in-law.

795
00:34:04,799 --> 00:34:06,240
Right now, our site's ledgers

796
00:34:06,240 --> 00:34:06,839
are in her hands.

797
00:34:09,320 --> 00:34:10,079
Call them all.

798
00:34:10,559 --> 00:34:11,239
Hurry up and go!

799
00:34:11,840 --> 00:34:13,119
Let's go, let's go.

800
00:34:14,719 --> 00:34:15,039
Here.

801
00:34:15,760 --> 00:34:16,360
Have some steamed buns.

802
00:34:17,079 --> 00:34:17,599
They're fresh out of the steamer.

803
00:34:18,880 --> 00:34:19,199
All right.

804
00:34:20,360 --> 00:34:21,199
Here, have some.

805
00:34:23,679 --> 00:34:24,079
If it's not enough,

806
00:34:25,320 --> 00:34:26,239
I'll get more for everyone.

807
00:34:29,599 --> 00:34:29,920
Dad.

808
00:34:30,880 --> 00:34:32,119
Do you see what's happening now?

809
00:34:33,199 --> 00:34:34,199
If you'd listened to me earlier

810
00:34:34,199 --> 00:34:34,800
and sold to Yang Er,

811
00:34:35,039 --> 00:34:36,000
would we be in this mess today?

812
00:34:36,400 --> 00:34:38,280
Right now, it's just our own workers showing up.

813
00:34:38,800 --> 00:34:40,800
Once the suppliers we owe money to arrive,

814
00:34:41,159 --> 00:34:42,039
have you thought about how to deal with them?

815
00:34:43,159 --> 00:34:44,199
How about I deal with it for you?

816
00:34:45,559 --> 00:34:46,960
Go find that white-haired guy over there,

817
00:34:47,039 --> 00:34:47,920
and ask him for the money!

818
00:34:47,920 --> 00:34:48,360
Shut up!

819
00:34:49,199 --> 00:34:49,800
Get out of here!

820
00:34:52,039 --> 00:34:53,239
Fine, I can leave.

821
00:34:53,559 --> 00:34:54,280
Good luck to you.

822
00:34:58,119 --> 00:34:58,559
Biaozi,

823
00:34:59,679 --> 00:35:00,480
what are your thoughts?

824
00:35:01,000 --> 00:35:01,400
Uncle...

825
00:35:02,159 --> 00:35:03,480
I don't know what to do either.

826
00:35:18,519 --> 00:35:19,599
Go tell the crew

827
00:35:20,519 --> 00:35:21,880
that working for our Ma family,

828
00:35:22,360 --> 00:35:23,960
even if I don't make a single cent,

829
00:35:24,119 --> 00:35:25,199
they won't get shortchanged.

830
00:35:26,360 --> 00:35:26,760
Jiao,

831
00:35:27,480 --> 00:35:28,239
come here for a second.

832
00:35:28,840 --> 00:35:29,159
Dad.

833
00:35:29,519 --> 00:35:30,400
Take my bankbook,

834
00:35:30,719 --> 00:35:32,039
go to the bank with Xiuming,

835
00:35:32,119 --> 00:35:33,159
and pay the workers their wages.

836
00:35:34,039 --> 00:35:34,639
Dad,

837
00:35:35,320 --> 00:35:36,719
that's your pension money!

838
00:35:36,920 --> 00:35:37,920
Uncle, this...

839
00:35:38,559 --> 00:35:39,639
th-this isn't right.

840
00:35:39,800 --> 00:35:40,679
Just go.

841
00:35:40,880 --> 00:35:41,599
Go on.

842
00:35:42,239 --> 00:35:42,679
Uncle...

843
00:35:44,039 --> 00:35:44,639
Old Ma!

844
00:35:46,239 --> 00:35:46,679
Uncle Wei!

845
00:35:47,079 --> 00:35:47,440
Uncle Wei!

846
00:35:47,800 --> 00:35:48,519
Old Wei is here.

847
00:35:48,599 --> 00:35:49,039
Boss Wei.

848
00:35:51,000 --> 00:35:51,719
The Phase 3 payment—

849
00:35:51,840 --> 00:35:52,639
I'll front it for you.

850
00:35:54,039 --> 00:35:56,000
Hurry and pay those wages,

851
00:35:56,679 --> 00:35:58,440
and what's owed to the suppliers.

852
00:35:58,880 --> 00:35:59,480
Clear all their debts.

853
00:36:00,320 --> 00:36:00,679
Old Wei...

854
00:36:01,920 --> 00:36:03,400
I don't know what to say. I...

855
00:36:03,559 --> 00:36:04,199
No, don't.

856
00:36:04,760 --> 00:36:05,400
There's one more thing.

857
00:36:07,960 --> 00:36:09,719
This termination agreement,

858
00:36:09,960 --> 00:36:10,800
you still have to sign it.

859
00:36:11,320 --> 00:36:13,360
Otherwise, Shi Yongnian won't pay up,

860
00:36:14,199 --> 00:36:14,559
you know?

861
00:36:38,519 --> 00:36:38,840
Alright.

862
00:36:53,800 --> 00:36:56,199
The construction site Sai Duoxi held so dear

863
00:36:57,440 --> 00:36:58,000
was shut down.

864
00:37:00,320 --> 00:37:03,159
The business that fed Duoxi's family,

865
00:37:04,679 --> 00:37:05,440
just like that,

866
00:37:06,960 --> 00:37:08,639
came to an abrupt halt.

867
00:37:55,039 --> 00:37:55,400
Uncle!

868
00:37:56,400 --> 00:37:56,880
Uncle!

869
00:37:58,039 --> 00:37:58,679
Uncle!

870
00:37:59,360 --> 00:38:01,000
Uncle! Someone help!

871
00:38:01,880 --> 00:38:02,679
Uncle!

872
00:38:02,840 --> 00:38:03,519
Uncle Duoxi!

873
00:38:03,719 --> 00:38:05,000
Uncle! Uncle! Uncle!

874
00:38:05,039 --> 00:38:06,280
Uncle, what happened? What's wrong?

875
00:38:06,320 --> 00:38:07,039
Uncle!

876
00:38:07,280 --> 00:38:07,920
Uncle Duoxi!

877
00:38:08,000 --> 00:38:08,880
Uncle, are you okay?

878
00:38:08,880 --> 00:38:09,880
Say something! Say something!

879
00:38:09,880 --> 00:38:10,480
Wake up, Uncle!

880
00:38:10,480 --> 00:38:11,000
Are you all right? Are you okay?

881
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:11,760
Uncle Duoxi! Uncle Duoxi!

882
00:38:11,760 --> 00:38:13,000
Quick, get him to the hospital!

883
00:38:13,159 --> 00:38:14,000
Hurry! Hurry!

884
00:38:14,199 --> 00:38:14,679
Uncle!

885
00:38:33,000 --> 00:38:35,639
Our tower crane maintenance fee this month is

886
00:38:35,639 --> 00:38:36,840
4,500 yuan,

887
00:38:37,239 --> 00:38:37,880
and it's still unpaid.

888
00:38:38,599 --> 00:38:40,320
Once the crane operator saw this,

889
00:38:40,320 --> 00:38:41,280
he just walked off the job.

890
00:38:41,840 --> 00:38:44,719
Then for the site's permit paperwork,

891
00:38:45,199 --> 00:38:47,920
there are the tolls and parking fees,

892
00:38:48,039 --> 00:38:49,679
plus the dinners I hosted—

893
00:38:49,760 --> 00:38:51,119
the entertainment costs I fronted.

894
00:38:51,280 --> 00:38:53,000
Rent for the prefab cabins,

895
00:38:53,320 --> 00:38:54,559
replacing the safety nets,

896
00:38:54,960 --> 00:38:56,760
repairs on small equipment...

897
00:38:56,760 --> 00:38:58,480
Adding up all these bits and pieces,

898
00:38:58,480 --> 00:39:00,760
there's a 50,000-yuan hole left to plug.

899
00:39:01,320 --> 00:39:02,480
All in all,

900
00:39:02,840 --> 00:39:05,639
the total funding shortfall

901
00:39:06,199 --> 00:39:07,559
is still 300,000 yuan.

902
00:39:08,920 --> 00:39:10,599
Right, there's another thing I need to tell you.

903
00:39:11,480 --> 00:39:12,719
Uncle has already

904
00:39:12,719 --> 00:39:14,800
made a guarantee to the workers:

905
00:39:15,079 --> 00:39:15,639
three days.

906
00:39:16,599 --> 00:39:17,559
Just three days,

907
00:39:17,760 --> 00:39:19,239
and all the money owed to them

908
00:39:19,400 --> 00:39:20,760
will definitely be paid.

909
00:39:21,079 --> 00:39:21,719
Three days?

910
00:39:22,599 --> 00:39:23,119
300,000 yuan?

911
00:39:24,119 --> 00:39:24,679
Are we supposed to rob a bank?

912
00:39:25,880 --> 00:39:27,039
I just don't get it.

913
00:39:27,639 --> 00:39:28,760
Look at Wei Changfu.

914
00:39:29,199 --> 00:39:31,119
He could advance funds for Old Ma's team,

915
00:39:32,039 --> 00:39:33,199
so why won't he front any for us?

916
00:39:37,400 --> 00:39:38,199
In three days,

917
00:39:38,400 --> 00:39:39,079
this money

918
00:39:39,559 --> 00:39:40,159
must be scraped together.

919
00:39:40,360 --> 00:39:40,840
Otherwise,

920
00:39:40,840 --> 00:39:41,519
those workers

921
00:39:41,920 --> 00:39:42,800
will come make a scene again.

922
00:39:43,159 --> 00:39:43,880
When that happens, Dad

923
00:39:44,480 --> 00:39:45,719
won't even get to be treated in peace.

924
00:39:53,920 --> 00:39:55,280
Second Brother, what do you think?

925
00:39:57,199 --> 00:39:57,840
What do I think?

926
00:39:59,440 --> 00:40:00,719
I've already handed over the books.

927
00:40:00,719 --> 00:40:01,639
By right,

928
00:40:01,639 --> 00:40:03,400
whoever holds the account books now

929
00:40:03,400 --> 00:40:04,719
is responsible, right?

930
00:40:05,400 --> 00:40:05,880
Besides,

931
00:40:05,880 --> 00:40:06,840
I warned the old man before.

932
00:40:07,000 --> 00:40:07,760
I told him to drop it,

933
00:40:07,760 --> 00:40:08,360
but he wouldn't listen.

934
00:40:08,679 --> 00:40:10,000
So what do you expect me to think?

935
00:40:10,719 --> 00:40:11,320
Besides,

936
00:40:11,519 --> 00:40:12,719
the Phase 3 payment didn't come through.

937
00:40:12,800 --> 00:40:13,800
Can you blame me for that?

938
00:40:13,800 --> 00:40:14,679
Xiuliang,

939
00:40:15,000 --> 00:40:16,079
everyone knows

940
00:40:16,079 --> 00:40:16,880
that you're currently

941
00:40:16,880 --> 00:40:19,119
the Tengyue boss's favorite.

942
00:40:19,519 --> 00:40:21,199
It's just a matter of putting in a word.

943
00:40:21,199 --> 00:40:22,840
Why are you so unwilling to help us?

944
00:40:22,840 --> 00:40:23,480
Wait, Wen Jiayin.

945
00:40:23,480 --> 00:40:25,119
You're unbelievable.

946
00:40:25,320 --> 00:40:27,159
Why are you always thinking of cutting corners?

947
00:40:27,280 --> 00:40:27,760
A situation like this...

948
00:40:27,760 --> 00:40:29,400
Can this really be solved just by putting in a word?

949
00:40:29,519 --> 00:40:30,320
If it were that simple,

950
00:40:30,320 --> 00:40:31,639
I'd have spoken up long ago.

951
00:40:32,079 --> 00:40:34,639
Manage properly and do the work right—

952
00:40:34,920 --> 00:40:35,840
that's the only right way.

953
00:40:35,840 --> 00:40:37,199
The right path in life is never easy.

954
00:40:37,199 --> 00:40:37,599
Got it?

955
00:40:37,599 --> 00:40:38,719
Wait, who didn't do the work right?

956
00:40:38,719 --> 00:40:39,639
I'm talking about you! What of it?

957
00:40:39,639 --> 00:40:41,400
Hey, how can you speak to your eldest brother like that?

958
00:40:41,480 --> 00:40:42,280
Your big brother busted his back.

959
00:40:42,280 --> 00:40:43,440
How did he not do the work right?

960
00:40:43,440 --> 00:40:44,559
Who hasn't worked hard?

961
00:40:44,559 --> 00:40:45,360
Who's been lying around at home?

962
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:45,760
Enough!

963
00:40:46,199 --> 00:40:47,079
Stop all this pointless bickering.

964
00:40:47,079 --> 00:40:48,239
Let's talk about these three days first.

965
00:40:48,239 --> 00:40:49,119
What are we doing about the money?

966
00:40:49,400 --> 00:40:50,280
Such a waste of breath.

967
00:40:56,920 --> 00:40:58,480
If you really want my advice,

968
00:40:59,800 --> 00:41:00,880
it's actually quite simple:

969
00:41:01,199 --> 00:41:02,239
just do what Uncle Ma's family did.

970
00:41:02,599 --> 00:41:04,280
Settle up, clear accounts, and walk away.

971
00:41:04,360 --> 00:41:05,639
Easy for you to say!

972
00:41:05,840 --> 00:41:07,039
Dad's being treated inside right now!

973
00:41:07,280 --> 00:41:08,079
You dare sit here and say that?

974
00:41:08,239 --> 00:41:08,880
When Dad comes out,

975
00:41:08,880 --> 00:41:09,519
right to his face,

976
00:41:09,800 --> 00:41:10,320
say that again!

977
00:41:10,320 --> 00:41:10,840
Let me hear it!

978
00:41:10,840 --> 00:41:11,920
You think I wouldn't dare?

979
00:41:11,920 --> 00:41:13,920
You know full well Dad will never agree.

980
00:41:14,119 --> 00:41:15,719
Let's think of another way.

981
00:41:30,159 --> 00:41:30,920
As for a solution,

982
00:41:32,760 --> 00:41:33,599
there actually is one.

983
00:41:41,199 --> 00:41:42,360
But you really have to be the one to talk to him.

984
00:41:42,360 --> 00:41:43,719
Why should I be the one?

985
00:41:43,719 --> 00:41:45,840
Doesn't Dad always listen to you?

986
00:41:45,840 --> 00:41:47,159
Just because he listens to me doesn't mean I should!

987
00:41:47,440 --> 00:41:47,719
Sec—

988
00:41:51,599 --> 00:41:52,880
Second Brother,

989
00:42:01,280 --> 00:42:01,679
wait a second.

990
00:42:04,880 --> 00:42:05,840
What do you mean it's settled?

991
00:42:06,800 --> 00:42:07,400
How are you going to solve this?

992
00:42:07,599 --> 00:42:08,199
What's the plan?

993
00:42:08,800 --> 00:42:10,679
Will you use Dad's demolition payout

994
00:42:11,079 --> 00:42:11,960
to bail out the construction team?

995
00:42:12,280 --> 00:42:13,079
Is that what you mean, Second Brother?

996
00:42:13,960 --> 00:42:14,719
I don't agree.

997
00:42:15,239 --> 00:42:16,679
That construction team of yours is a bottomless pit.

998
00:42:16,679 --> 00:42:17,519
You can never fill it!

999
00:42:17,519 --> 00:42:18,960
Whose team is a pit? You—

1000
00:42:18,960 --> 00:42:20,320
Second Brother, once the old man comes out,

1001
00:42:20,519 --> 00:42:21,679
talk to him first

1002
00:42:21,679 --> 00:42:22,599
about splitting the demolition payout.

1003
00:42:22,599 --> 00:42:23,599
Give me my share first.

1004
00:42:23,679 --> 00:42:25,280
Then I'll take my share,

1005
00:42:25,280 --> 00:42:26,679
and Eldest Brother, you take yours.

1006
00:42:26,679 --> 00:42:27,559
And into your construction team,

1007
00:42:27,559 --> 00:42:29,000
sink as much into it as you please.

1008
00:42:29,079 --> 00:42:30,159
Just give me my share first!

1009
00:42:30,159 --> 00:42:30,679
Sai Xiuhe,

1010
00:42:30,840 --> 00:42:31,760
can you stop making a scene?

1011
00:42:31,760 --> 00:42:32,960
Dad is still being resuscitated in there!

1012
00:42:32,960 --> 00:42:33,559
When he comes out—

1013
00:42:34,039 --> 00:42:34,639
Dad's out!

1014
00:42:34,639 --> 00:42:34,960
Dad!

1015
00:42:35,760 --> 00:42:36,119
Dad!

1016
00:42:36,800 --> 00:42:37,239
Dad!

1017
00:42:37,239 --> 00:42:37,719
You're all here.

1018
00:42:38,599 --> 00:42:39,400
Dad, are you alright, Dad?

1019
00:42:39,400 --> 00:42:40,199
Move, move! Out of the way!

1020
00:42:41,639 --> 00:42:41,960
Careful.

1021
00:42:42,559 --> 00:42:43,199
How is he doing?

1022
00:42:43,199 --> 00:42:43,599
You're all here.

1023
00:42:50,760 --> 00:42:51,800
Speak up, then.

1024
00:42:53,320 --> 00:42:54,199
What are you going to do?

1025
00:42:57,880 --> 00:42:59,159
What the hell is this?

1026
00:42:59,440 --> 00:42:59,800
Dad...

1027
00:43:00,679 --> 00:43:01,360
We have to front the money.

1028
00:43:03,239 --> 00:43:04,239
Pull the plug.

1029
00:43:04,599 --> 00:43:06,280
Dad, we have to cover this money.

1030
00:43:07,239 --> 00:43:08,280
I'm not fronting a dime.

1031
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:21,000
All the documents in here—

1032
00:43:21,119 --> 00:43:22,079
I have to sign off on every single one.

1033
00:43:22,199 --> 00:43:23,440
I'm the one held primarily responsible.

1034
00:43:23,440 --> 00:43:24,199
You know that?

1035
00:43:24,280 --> 00:43:25,199
Who are you responsible to?

1036
00:43:25,320 --> 00:43:25,840
What I mean is,

1037
00:43:25,840 --> 00:43:26,800
if you do this,

1038
00:43:26,800 --> 00:43:28,840
you're pushing me right into the fire.

1039
00:43:29,199 --> 00:43:31,079
Let's resolve this issue at the root.

1040
00:43:31,079 --> 00:43:31,840
Can't we?

1041
00:43:31,840 --> 00:43:32,519
No.

1042
00:43:32,679 --> 00:43:33,679
It's impossible to sort out.

1043
00:43:34,360 --> 00:43:36,800
All my contracts were signed with Changfu.

1044
00:43:37,239 --> 00:43:38,920
Now Changfu owes me money.

1045
00:43:39,480 --> 00:43:41,320
So I guess we'll see each other in court.

1046
00:43:42,719 --> 00:43:43,960
Y-You're really going to sue me?
